  "instructions": "Measured scientific-conference narration in Alloy. Calm, precise, and authoritative. Motivate the first four sentences warmly and conditionally, with no result cadence. Give semantic adjudication the strongest intellectual emphasis. Do not imply that an eligibility value has been revealed.",
